# The public keys a cell release must be signed with (S-17 (a),
# docs/runtime/isolation-p3-snapshots.md), one "kodus-cell-release-key
# <base64>" line each. Compiled into the cell (releasesig.Pinned) and copied
# into the installer, which passes it to `cell update -keys`.
#
# Empty until the release owner makes the key pair
# (scripts/sign-release.sh generate): with no key pinned, `cell update`
# refuses every release. The private half goes only into the release
# workflow's secret RUNTIME_CELL_RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY, never into this tree.
